          "english_quote": "Clement’s Epitome of Peter’s Sojourn-Preachings.",
          "issue": "The compound preserves ἐπιδημίων as qualifying the preachings, and the preceding city-by-city description supports an association with Peter's visits or stays. Nevertheless, the adjective's precise force remains unresolved between visit-associated and local/public senses. The existing disclosure identifies this as publication-blocking. The provisional compound does not itself resolve the lexical uncertainty, and no defect in the verified Greek has been established.",
          "suggested_revision": "Provide separate, cited lexical evidence for ἐπιδήμιος in comparable literary contexts, explicitly distinguishing evidence for the adjective from evidence merely for cognate nouns or verbs. Assess that evidence against the supplied title and preceding description. Retain the provisional title and alternatives pending assessment; any replacement requires fresh review. Keep the discussion of ἐπιγράψαντα separate as a syntactic feature: ἐπιγράψας remains a proposed normalization, not an established correction.",
