          "english_quote": "Nevertheless, all of you know that the bishop toils more than all of you",
          "issue": "The main text chooses indicative γινώσκετε, asserting the hearers’ existing knowledge. The form also permits an imperative, asking everyone to recognize the bishop’s greater toil; that reading has substantial contextual support in this sequence of directives. The indicative is defensible, but this material difference between assertion and exhortation is not disclosed.",
