          "issue": "The draft makes both ζωοποιοὺς λόγους and ἐκκλησίας κανόνα objects of ἀγνοῶν, then takes οὐκ εἰδώς absolutely as “without knowledge.” That construction is defensible, but the notes omit the more straightforward alternative attachment: ζωοποιοὺς λόγους belongs to ἀγνοῶν, while ἐκκλησίας κανόνα belongs to οὐκ εἰδώς. The existing discussion of negation scope does not disclose this separate object-attachment question. The alternative also preserves the source’s distinct formulations for ignorance more transparently. This is interpretive uncertainty, not evidence of source corruption.",
